--TEST--
`prepareRename` on the `foreach` keyword is refused, because a keyword is no symbol, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
array<int> $rows = [1, 2, 3];
forea<|>ch ($rows as int $row) {
    echo $row;
}
--REQUEST--
prepareRename
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
